Greetings Mr. Epstein,

The following photographs are of boat parts for sale by Charles Parlotto (Buzz). He was the owner of the former
Lighthouse Marine, which is now his warehouse, and the present owner of SOS Antiques, his store on St.
Thomas. He also has a store in Florida, and is willing to provide photographs of inventory there if you are
interested.

Buzz claims to have antiques dating back to the 15th to 18th centuries. Everything is for sale, and he is quite
open to negotiating on prices. I am still looking for a source for the large metal panels for your reveiw.

Respectfully submitted,

Daphne




